      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports role-playing as involving the therapist assigning and guiding enactment of roles and enabling patients to “rehearse new behaviors,” but it does not specifically state that behavioral rehearsal strengthens change by “trying out responses in action rather than only talking about them.”",
